OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland's young drivers
OL,4,Afirst in UK to get new driving
OL,5,Alicensing laws
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland has become the first
OL,8,Fpart of the UK to introduce new rules
OL,9,Ffor new drivers in a bid to reduce
OL,10,Ffatal road crashes involving young
OL,11,Fpeople.
OL,13,FGraduated driver licensing (GDL), for
OL,14,Flearner and newly qualified drivers,
OL,15,Fapply to all new drivers but are
OL,16,Fparticularly aimed at 17 to
OL,17,F23-year-olds.
OL,19,FAmong the new rules is that learners
OL,20,Fmust spend at least six months getting
OL,21,Fdriving experience before they can take
OL,22,Fa practical test.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
