OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland's young drivers
OL,4,Afirst in UK to get new driving
OL,5,Alicensing laws
OL,6,
OL,7,FNewly qualified drivers under 24 will
OL,8,Falso face restrictions on carrying
OL,9,Fyoung passengers at night.
